	<p>Hi, I'm Md Nauman Athar Hasan. I build backend systems, developer tools, and small web experiments. I usually work with Go, TypeScript, and Cloudflare.</p>
	<p>I work on ideas that I find interesting. Some become useful projects; others become lessons. When I am not coding, I am usually reading or writing about something I want to understand better.</p>
	<p>You can find my projects on <a href="https://github.com/mnah05" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a>, follow me on <a href="https://x.com/mnah05" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">X</a>, or connect on <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/nauman-hasan-53a66630a/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn</a>.</p>
	<p>I write longer posts on <a href="https://medium.com/@mnah05" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Medium</a> and <a href="https://substack.com/@naumanhasan" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Substack</a>. My <a href="https://workwithnauman.raindrop.page/reads-72899412" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">reading list</a> is on Raindrop.</p>
